/*
# Seed invoices linked to work orders

1. Purpose
   - Link invoices to completed/unbilled work orders so the Accounting column
     in the work orders list shows a mix of green "Invoice" (paid) and red
     "Invoice" (sent/overdue) badges instead of only blue "Estimate" badges.

2. What this does
   - Inserts 40 new invoices, each tied to a distinct work order.
   - The first 20 are marked "paid" (all amounts settled).
   - The next 12 are marked "sent" (unpaid).
   - The last 8 are marked "overdue" (past-due).
   - Invoice numbers follow the pattern INV-2026-2XXX.
   - Amounts are realistic service call totals ($150 – $2 400).

3. Tables modified
   - `invoices` — 40 new rows inserted.

4. Security
   - No schema or policy changes.
*/

